   "ruling": "Ruling: model error; the model says the restatement (Form 1040 line 2b plus line 3b, BUG-0391) includes Alaska Permanent Fund dividends. f4952 p. 3, Line 4a: \"ordinary dividends (except Alaska Permanent Fund dividends)\". Form 1040 line 3b is Schedule B line 6 (Form 1099-DIV ordinary dividends); Alaska Permanent Fund dividends are entered on Schedule 1 line 8g (s1.yaml; p525 p. 31, \"report it as income on Schedule 1\") and never reach line 3b. Same point as the earlier rulings on the Schedule B restatement.",
