   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; project retained. f4952 line 4b, \"Enter the portion of ordinary dividends included on line 4a that are qualified dividends\": f4952.unsupported refuses investment income other than interest and ordinary dividends, so in scope every qualified dividend on Form 1040 line 3a is included on line 4a; the Form 1041 alternative is for estates and trusts, not this return. The box 1a condition is the line 3a gate: qualified dividends are part of ordinary dividends (i1040gi p. 25, Line 3a).",
